THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Zhen links two dependencies, both from Apple and both under the Apache
License 2.0. Keeping the count that low is deliberate: every addition is a
supply chain this project then owns.

  swift-argument-parser   https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser
                          Copyright Apple Inc. and the Swift project authors
                          Apache License 2.0
                          Linked by the command-line tool.

  swift-docc-plugin       https://github.com/apple/swift-docc-plugin
                          Copyright Apple Inc. and the Swift project authors
                          Apache License 2.0
                          A build-tool plugin only. It contributes documentation
                          subcommands and links nothing into any shipped binary.

Nothing else is vendored, bundled or statically linked. Zhen spawns no
subprocesses and depends on no external binaries at runtime.
